[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/comments/1128906923","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/issues/10007#issuecomment-1128906923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/10007","id":1128906923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAGnPe85DScCr","user":{"login":"jsteemann","id":1423118,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjMxMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1423118?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann","html_url":"https://github.com/jsteemann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsteemann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-17T13:58:35Z","updated_at":"2022-05-17T13:58:35Z","body":"Btw, using `ingest_options.snapshot_consistency = false;` will probably fix this one example test, but still leads to other \"gap in sequence numbers\" errors in more complex use cases.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/comments/1128906923/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/comments/1130218456","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/issues/10007#issuecomment-1130218456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/10007","id":1130218456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAGnPe85DXcPY","user":{"login":"riversand963","id":20094703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDk0NzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20094703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963","html_url":"https://github.com/riversand963","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-18T16:14:24Z","updated_at":"2022-05-18T16:14:24Z","body":"The `bool strict` argument in `TransactionLogIteratorImpl::SeekToStartSequence(..., bool strict)` does not make much sense to me. It's pretty hard to use because it's difficult for the application to pick a sequence number, pass it to `GetUpdatesSince()` and expect it to be exactly the starting sequence number of a write batch in the WAL. The reason is that RocksDB can merge write batches from multiple threads writing to the db. Also remember that, for write-committed transactions, a write batch can cover a range of sequence numbers.\r\n\r\nBack to the issue here, if `snapshot_consistency` is true, I think we need to increment the sequence number. It is TransactionLogIterator that needs to be adapted. I can understand the original motivation for checking contiguous sequence numbers, but the assumption has changed since then. We need to update TransactionLogIterator. @siying can correct me if I missing anything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/comments/1130218456/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/comments/1130218965","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/issues/10007#issuecomment-1130218965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/10007","id":1130218965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAGnPe85DXcXV","user":{"login":"riversand963","id":20094703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDk0NzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20094703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963","html_url":"https://github.com/riversand963","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riversand963/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-05-18T16:14:54Z","updated_at":"2022-05-18T16:14:54Z","body":"Assigning myself to follow-up.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/rocksdb/issues/comments/1130218965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"roc